wasm32: a 32-bit size_t.

The stubs know a 64-bit size_t only, as ctypes' ctypes_primitives.h they
copy, which also handles 32 bits: integers' Size_t is then a UInt32.

--- a/src/bindings/blst_bindings_stubs.c
+++ b/src/bindings/blst_bindings_stubs.c
@@
 #define ctypes_copy_size_t integers_copy_uint64
+#elif SIZE_MAX == UINT32_MAX
+#define ctypes_size_t_val Uint32_val
+#define ctypes_copy_size_t integers_copy_uint32
 #else
